            "review_title": "Review at Gifuya Hcmc",
            "review_text": "Hiro\n136 contributions\n1\nCozy Japanese Restaurant\nSep 2019 • Friends\nIt's a cozy Japanese restaurant in Le Thanh Ton. I had yakitori chicken skewers and mabo tofu. Chicken skin skewer was so nice as it's so crunchy and full of flavour. The mabo tofu was cooked with fresh black pepper and tasted great too. They have Japanese traditional food with good sake. If you are into Japanese izakaya bar style, this place would be perfect for you.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 25, 2019",
