            "review_text": "clem3-16\nPerth, Australia149 contributions\n0\nHidden gem\nAug 2018 • Couples\nGifuya is hidden away in a little back lane system (khu pho) but it’s well worth finding. We stumbled on it by chance and stopped for lunch just getting their lunch special.\n\nEvery mouthful was perfect! We each had different chicken dishes, one a fillet and the other karaage. The fillet was so tender with an amazing sauce and the karaage was crisp and tender.\n\nThis area of Saigon has lots of Japanese restaurants, bars and clubs, all of which look very authentic. Even the alleys have a distinctly different feel, I highly recommend exploring the area.\nRead more\nWritten August 5, 2018",
